# Check out with LF on every platform. GitHub's Windows runners set
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites every line ending on checkout and makes
# `zig fmt --check` reject the entire tree — zig fmt requires LF. Without this
# the format gate is unrunnable on a third of the CI matrix, and a contributor
# on Windows commits a whole-file diff the first time they touch anything.
* text=auto eol=lf
